---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

---

<BaseLayout title="Projects | Minjoo's Home">
	<section class="page-section">
		<p class="eyebrow">Projects</p>
		<h1>프로젝트 페이지</h1>
		<p>
			비슷한 형식의 카드와 상세정보를 반복해서 보여줄 작업 목록 공간입니다.
		</p>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.page-section {
		max-width: 760px;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 16px;
		color: #767676;
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);
		line-height: 1.1;
		letter-spacing: 0;
		word-break: keep-all;
	}

	p {
		margin: 24px 0 0;
		color: #555555;
		font-size: 18px;
		line-height: 1.8;
		word-break: keep-all;
	}
</style>
